{
    "title": "\u041f\u0435\u0440\u0435\u043a\u0440\u0435\u0441\u0442\u043e\u043a \u0434\u043e\u0441\u0442\u0430\u0432\u043a\u0430 \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0434\u0443\u043a\u0442\u043e\u0432",
    "description": "500 rubles discount on your first purchase when ordering over 1500 rubles using promo code NEW200. The promotional code is not valid on discounted or first price items.\r\n\r\n\"Crossroads\" - grocery delivery and your favorite loyalty program in one application! \r\n\r\nNow in \"Crossroads\":\r\n\r\n<b>Fast delivery of food and fresh products</b> from the nearest Perekrestok store. Don't carry heavy bags - order products online directly to your home.\r\n<b>Checking the availability of goods in stores</b> - check at home the availability of goods in the nearest supermarket.\r\n<b>Item scanning</b> - scan an item that is running low and immediately add it to your order cart.\r\n<b>Promotions and personal offers</b> - receive personal discounts, cashback, coupons for purchases at Perekrestok.\r\n<b>\u201cOrdered before\u201d</b> - save the list of products and order it again in one click.\r\n<b>Unique privileges from partners.</b>\r\nSelect <b>Favorite product</b> and receive a 20% discount on its purchase with a Club card.\r\n\r\nWherever you are - at home or in the supermarket - our application has everything to make purchases as profitable as possible.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\uded2Crossroads Club: GREAT SHOPPINGS\r\n\r\n- Club card - now it is always with you.\r\n- Your own cashback - scan receipts and get cashback for purchasing promotional items.\r\n- Points balance, purchase history and receipts - no need to store paper receipts.\r\n- Product prices and availability - check the price and availability of goods in the store directly on your smartphone.\r\n- Contact - write to us if you want to praise our employees or if you have any problems.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc9aFAVORITE SUPERMARKET \u201cCROSSROADS\u201d: FOOD AND PRODUCTS\r\n\r\n- More than 15,000 items of products and goods for delivery: fresh vegetables and fruits, dairy products and eggs, meat, fish and seafood, frozen foods, groceries, bread and baked goods, drinks, household chemicals, pet products, household goods and supplies children, prepared food and cooking.\r\n- All current promotions, coupons and discounts - constantly more than 1,000 products are sold at a significant discount. You can find out and order in one click.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfc3\ud83c\udffb\u200d\u2642\ufe0fFAST DELIVERY OF FOOD AND PRODUCTS TO YOUR DOOR OR SELF-PICKUP\r\n\r\n- Delivery of groceries and food operates every day from 9 to 21, without weekends and holidays.\r\n- We deliver food to your home - Moscow and the region, St. Petersburg (St. Petersburg), Rostov-on-Don, Krasnodar, Kazan, Voronezh, Nizhny Novgorod, Samara and Yekaterinburg.\r\n- Fast delivery by courier. If we are late, we will warn you.\r\n- There is pick-up - you can collect a basket and just stop by an online grocery store and immediately pick up the packages.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd50CONVENIENT SERVICE\r\n\r\n- Prices for groceries and food in the application correspond to prices in supermarkets.\r\n- Scan an item that is running low and immediately add it to your order cart.\r\n- Create a shopping list and order it in one click.\r\n- We quickly collect food orders in the nearest store, so if something runs out, we will offer a replacement.\r\n- We control the expiration date of food and the quality of products.\r\n- If you don\u2019t like the product or no longer need it, you can refuse.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcb6PAYMENT AND DELIVERY\r\n\r\n- Payment by card online directly in the application.\r\n- Use coupons and discounts.\r\n- Home delivery of food to your door - you don\u2019t have to contact the courier.\r\n\r\n\u201cPerekrestok\u201d is your favorite online grocery store with delivery in your smartphone. Join the Club - buy products profitably and quickly! \r\n\r\n\ud83d\udccdDelivery works: Moscow and the region, St. Petersburg (St. Petersburg), Rostov-on-Don, Krasnodar, Kazan, Voronezh, Nizhny Novgorod - see delivery addresses directly in the application.\r\n\r\nIf you have any questions, contact us by calling our support number 8-800-200-95-55 or write to the application chat. We pay close attention to all requests and will try to respond as soon as possible. It is impossible to order food and goods through these contacts.",
    "descriptionHTML": "500 rubles discount on your first purchase when ordering over 1500 rubles using promo code NEW200. The promotional code is not valid on discounted or first price items.<br><br>&quot;Crossroads&quot; - grocery delivery and your favorite loyalty program in one application! <br><br>Now in &quot;Crossroads&quot;:<br><br><b>Fast delivery of food and fresh products</b> from the nearest Perekrestok store. Don&#39;t carry heavy bags - order products online directly to your home.<br><b>Checking the availability of goods in stores</b> - check at home the availability of goods in the nearest supermarket.<br><b>Item scanning</b> - scan an item that is running low and immediately add it to your order cart.<br><b>Promotions and personal offers</b> - receive personal discounts, cashback, coupons for purchases at Perekrestok.<br><b>\u201cOrdered before\u201d</b> - save the list of products and order it again in one click.<br><b>Unique privileges from partners.</b><br>Select <b>Favorite product</b> and receive a 20% discount on its purchase with a Club card.<br><br>Wherever you are - at home or in the supermarket - our application has everything to make purchases as profitable as possible.<br><br>\ud83d\uded2Crossroads Club: GREAT SHOPPINGS<br><br>- Club card - now it is always with you.<br>- Your own cashback - scan receipts and get cashback for purchasing promotional items.<br>- Points balance, purchase history and receipts - no need to store paper receipts.<br>- Product prices and availability - check the price and availability of goods in the store directly on your smartphone.<br>- Contact - write to us if you want to praise our employees or if you have any problems.<br><br>\ud83d\udc9aFAVORITE SUPERMARKET \u201cCROSSROADS\u201d: FOOD AND PRODUCTS<br><br>- More than 15,000 items of products and goods for delivery: fresh vegetables and fruits, dairy products and eggs, meat, fish and seafood, frozen foods, groceries, bread and baked goods, drinks, household chemicals, pet products, household goods and supplies children, prepared food and cooking.<br>- All current promotions, coupons and discounts - constantly more than 1,000 products are sold at a significant discount. You can find out and order in one click.<br><br>\ud83c\udfc3\ud83c\udffb\u200d\u2642\ufe0fFAST DELIVERY OF FOOD AND PRODUCTS TO YOUR DOOR OR SELF-PICKUP<br><br>- Delivery of groceries and food operates every day from 9 to 21, without weekends and holidays.<br>- We deliver food to your home - Moscow and the region, St. Petersburg (St. Petersburg), Rostov-on-Don, Krasnodar, Kazan, Voronezh, Nizhny Novgorod, Samara and Yekaterinburg.<br>- Fast delivery by courier. If we are late, we will warn you.<br>- There is pick-up - you can collect a basket and just stop by an online grocery store and immediately pick up the packages.<br><br>\ud83d\udd50CONVENIENT SERVICE<br><br>- Prices for groceries and food in the application correspond to prices in supermarkets.<br>- Scan an item that is running low and immediately add it to your order cart.<br>- Create a shopping list and order it in one click.<br>- We quickly collect food orders in the nearest store, so if something runs out, we will offer a replacement.<br>- We control the expiration date of food and the quality of products.<br>- If you don\u2019t like the product or no longer need it, you can refuse.<br><br>\ud83d\udcb6PAYMENT AND DELIVERY<br><br>- Payment by card online directly in the application.<br>- Use coupons and discounts.<br>- Home delivery of food to your door - you don\u2019t have to contact the courier.<br><br>\u201cPerekrestok\u201d is your favorite online grocery store with delivery in your smartphone. Join the Club - buy products profitably and quickly! <br><br>\ud83d\udccdDelivery works: Moscow and the region, St. Petersburg (St. Petersburg), Rostov-on-Don, Krasnodar, Kazan, Voronezh, Nizhny Novgorod - see delivery addresses directly in the application.<br><br>If you have any questions, contact us by calling our support number 8-800-200-95-55 or write to the application chat. We pay close attention to all requests and will try to respond as soon as possible. It is impossible to order food and goods through these contacts.",
